CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'pRSN->len >= 6'
#50: FILE: drivers/staging/vt6655/wpa.c:120:
+	if ((pRSN->len >= 6) /* oui1(4)+ver(2) */
+	    && (pRSN->byElementID == WLAN_EID_RSN_WPA)
+	    && !memcmp(pRSN->abyOUI, abyOUI01, 4)
 	    && (pRSN->wVersion == 1)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

